<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Job Opportunities</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/nav.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/jobOpportunities.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    </div>
    <main>
        <h1>Join Our Team</h1>
        <p>We’re always looking for talented and passionate individuals to join our growing team. Explore our latest job openings below and take the next step in your career with Ayurveda Care.</p>
        
        <div class="job-listings">
            <div class="job-card">
                <h2>Software Developer</h2>
                <p>Build and maintain web and mobile applications for Ayurveda Care. Work closely with our team to deliver seamless user experiences.</p>
                <p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote</p>
                <button onclick="window.location.href='/softwaredeveloper'">Apply Now</button>
            </div>
            <div class="job-card">
                <h2>Ayurveda Doctor</h2>
                <p>Provide expert Ayurvedic consultations, recommend personalized treatments, and guide patients on holistic healing approaches.</p>
                <p><strong>Location:</strong> Kitchener, Canada</p>
                <button onclick="window.location.href='/doctorapply'">Apply Now</button>
            </div>
            <div class="job-card">
                <h2>Customer Support Executive</h2>
                <p>Assist our customers by resolving their queries and providing excellent support for Ayurveda Care services and products.</p>
                <p><strong>Location:</strong> Waterloo, Canada</p>
                <button onclick="window.location.href='apply.html'">Apply Now</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2025 Ayurveda Care. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>